  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internews (EMA)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internews (EMA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective: - Contribute to peace building, security and social cohesion in Sudan.

Project Objective: - Create a conducive environment to improve citizens access to high-quality information that enables them to make better-informed decisions, foster social cohesion and holds power to account.

Intermediate objective 1: - Build the capacity of  (media outlets, Journalists, citizen journalists) to cover political processes professionally and securely.

Intermediate objective 2: - Support CSOs and strengthen collaboration between the media and other civil society actors.

Intermediate objective 3: - Reinforce the operational resilience of media and information providers through rapid response support</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidragen syftar till att skapa en inkluderande informationsmilj&#xf6;  f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra medborgarnas tillg&#xe5;ng till oberoende information av h&#xf6;g kvalitet som g&#xf6;r det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r dem att delta i landets &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ng till demokrati och st&#xe4;lla sina nya ledare till svars.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims at creating an inclusive information environment  to improve citizens&#x2019; access to high quality independent information that enables them to participate in the country&#x2019;s democratic transition and hold their new leaders to account</narrative>
  </description>
